GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner-decisions

### Approve yellow booking decision
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner-decisions/1/approve

### Reject a pending decision
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner-decisions/2/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejectReason": "Owner rejected — needs revised budget"
}

### Set agent semaphore
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/1/semaphore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "semaphore": "yellow"
}
